# Plugin: Dispatching Parallel Agents Adapter

Purpose:
  Adapt Superpowers dispatching-parallel-agents skill for SDDRA scheduler.

Source:
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\{project_name}\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\dispatching-parallel-agents\SKILL.md

Original:
  Concurrent subagent workflows
  Parallel execution with checkpoints

Adapted for SDDRA:
  Parallel execution in chain graph:
    - FE and MD can run in parallel
    - Independent tasks can run concurrently
    - Dependency graph determines parallelism

  Scheduler rules:
    - Task dependencies MUST be satisfied before execution
    - Parallel tasks MUST NOT share mutable state
    - Checkpoints after each parallel batch

  Integration:
    - Chain graph parallel section
    - Task scheduler in .sdd/projects/{project_name}/tasks/
    - Token budget shared across parallel tasks

Usage:
  Referenced by:
    .sdd/chains/feature.sdd (Parallel section)
    .sdd/chains/INDEX.sdd

  Triggers:
    - Multiple tasks ready
    - No dependencies between tasks
    - Token budget available

State: Adapted
